#==============================================================================================
#
#   http - LibHTTP's HTTP code point classes and quoted-string collection
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibHTTP/HTTP.h (lines 32-76: is_http_newline, is_http_tab_or_space,
#       is_http_token_code_point, HttpQuotedStringExtractValue) and HTTP.cpp (lines 14-75:
#       collect_an_http_quoted_string). The constants of HTTP.h (HTTP_TAB_OR_SPACE,
#       HTTP_WHITESPACE and the byte arrays) are in types_http. Region r13 ported the quoted
#       string for MIME type parsing; region p2b the rest.
